Manuscript.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is the `groupeval` package ONLY. Everything below belongs to the polyp
# benchmark audit that the package was extracted from: the audit implementation, its test suite,
# its results, its runner, its bibliography and its manuscript build step. All of it is a
# different deliverable with a different licence and different venue implications, and it kept
# leaking in one file at a time (the manuscript, then references.bib) because the git repository
# is rooted in the audit project's own directory.
src/
tests/
results/
reproduce.py
references.bib
references.ris
requirements-audit.txt
requirements-analysis.txt
package.json
package-lock.json

# Local preview of the PyPI project page, generated for review; not part of the package.
pypi-preview.html
